     upper street n5 - n6. East of n4 a curved street (inner points n9, n10) to n8, an approach to a roundabout
     (r1 west, r4 south, r3 east, r2 north; counterclockwise) with three exits: south, east, north.
     A town, two houses, a filling station. -->
